sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App
    participant LocalDB
    participant SyncQueue
    participant Cloud

    User->>App: Performs action (Add Invoice)
    App->>LocalDB: Write data locally
    App->>User: Show success (immediate)
    App->>SyncQueue: Add change to queue
    Note over App,LocalDB: Offline complete
    SyncQueue->>Cloud: Wait for internet
    Cloud->>SyncQueue: Acknowledge
    SyncQueue->>LocalDB: Mark as synced